{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46854","headline":"谢橘洲人寄橘 · 齐己","name":"谢橘洲人寄橘","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洞庭栽种似潇湘，绿遶人家带夕阳。\n霜裛露蒸千树熟，浪围风撼一洲香。\n洪崖遣後名何远，陆绩怀来事更长。\n藏贮待供宾客好，石榴宜称映舟光。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46854.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46854","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}